<title>JAPAN: Takasago Int'l - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takasago Int'l - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 32.50		vs	   31.91</p>
<p> Operating	    2.41		vs	    2.34</p>
<p> Current		2.55		vs	    2.66</p>
<p> Net		    1.37		vs	    1.31</p>
<p> EPS		   13.63 yen	  vs	   13.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    101 million	  vs	 101 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Takasago International Corp is a manufacturer of fragrance, flavour and aromatic chemicals.</p>
